## 🧭 Career & Practical Tips

* Start small — map one App A CSV to one App B CSV manually.
* Keep your mapping in Excel — even if you later automate, this document is gold.
* Practice *data profiling*: checking value types, uniqueness, formats, etc.
* As you improve, you can move from manual mapping → semi-automated → fully automated.

